flowchart TD
    A([User Question]) --> B{Question Complexity?}

    %% Chatbot Path
    B -->|Simple Question| C[Chatbot Path]
    C --> D[LLM answers directly]
    D --> Z([Final Response])

    %% ReAct Agent Path
    B -->|Complex / Personalized Career Question| E[ReAct Agent Path]
    E --> F[Thought: Analyze user intent and identify missing information]
    F --> G[Action: Call Career Tool / Knowledge Base]
    G --> H[Observation: Receive career information]
    H --> I{Need another tool?}

    I -->|Yes| J[Action: Call additional tool]
    J --> K[Observation: Receive new information]
    K --> I

    I -->|No| L[Thought: Synthesize all observations]
    L --> M[Generate personalized recommendation]
    M --> Z([Final Response])

    %% Error Handling
    G -. Tool Error .-> N[Fallback / Guardrail Response]
    J -. Tool Error .-> N
    N --> Z
    